    m_Untranslated: Instructions
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>1.</b>  In the <b>Project</b> window, navigate to <b>_Unity_Essentials</b> > <b>Scenes.</b> \n\n<b>2.</b>  Find <b>4_LivingRoom_Programming_Scene</b> and double-click to open it. \n\n<b>3.</b>  Adjust your view of the 3D scene to see the living room interior layout from a good angle."
